        <div id="how-we-tested" class="scroll-mt-24">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-16 mb-6 font-sans border-b pb-4">
            How We Tested: Real Fences, Both Sides, 12 Months
          </h2>
          <p>
            We built and sourced four fence-style test sections to represent the range of wood fencing homeowners actually own: a 60-foot run of pressure-treated pine privacy fence, a cedar shadowbox fence, a painted-picket-style pine fence, and a short run of split-rail. Every surface was cleaned, stripped of any prior finish, brightened where needed, and dried to under 15% moisture content before sealing, verified with a calibrated moisture meter.
